  <p id="c-chenshu-009-ouyangwei-family-context:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-chenshu-009-ouyangwei-family-context:p001:m0000" ref="qil_wym_gc2_AA">歐陽頠</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-009-ouyangwei-family-context:p001:m0004" ref="qil_wym_gc2_AA">靖世</persName>，長沙臨湘人也。為郡豪族。祖<persName id="c-chenshu-009-ouyangwei-family-context:p001:m0020" ref="qil_wym_gc2">景達</persName>，梁代為本州治中。父<persName id="c-chenshu-009-ouyangwei-family-context:p001:m0032" ref="qil_wym_gc2_A">僧寶</persName>，屯騎校尉。</p>
